fix.summary:
DaemonSet/kube-system/node-problem-detector: add this monitor to its custom config ConfigMap as gpu-xid-monitor.json and append its path to --config.system-log-monitor (deliveryhero chart: settings.custom_monitor_definitions and settings.log_monitors):
{
  "plugin": "kmsg",
  "logPath": "/dev/kmsg",
  "lookback": "5m",
  "bufferSize": 10,
  "source": "gpu-xid-monitor",
  "conditions": [
    {"type": "GPUProblem", "reason": "NoGPUXid", "message": "no fatal NVIDIA Xid in the kernel log"}
  ],
  "rules": [
    {"type": "permanent", "condition": "GPUProblem", "reason": "NVIDIAXid", "pattern": "NVRM: Xid [(][^)]*[)]: (48|64|74|79|94|95|119|120|140),.*"}
  ]
}
forge never edits a node-problem-detector it did not install.
